(text "Two actual100-contact sockets; purchasedcomputeSoM is a separate assembly. CM5 officialnative pad geometry preserves mating orientation.\nUnused exactcontacts areNC; requiredexternalSD/USB/HDMI/Ethernet/PCIe endpoints remain visible as unfinishedboundaries.\nNo universalBTT electrical compatibility, automaticID, targetimage, mountedkeepout or physicalcurrentqualification is claimed."(at 17.78 250.19 0)(effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))(uuid "5fe5b0b7-b4d8-51e3-a0b3-455ef3f242ce"))
(text "HOSTSPI defaults: CLK/MOSI LOW, bothCS HIGH; fourforward Ioff buffers and one module-powered return.\nEnable requires actualCM3V3 supervision AND FPGA resetreleased AND CDONE. Read-onlyUARTTX is contact55/GPIO14.\nDIP is only cold-start profilemetadata, with0=AUTO/serviceuntil exactID; it cannot grantpower/motionpermission.\nAmphenol blanket0.3A/allcontacts gives1.8A acrosssix5Vcontacts: planned2.5A needs selective-contact rating/thermalproof."(at 17.78 483.87 0)(effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))(uuid "575a5575-023a-5d2f-abc6-fd41218bd75a"))
(text "Manufacturingblocked: noexternalportconnectors here; rawhighspeedboundaries stillrequire actualprotection/portcircuits.\nOnecustommotherboard; noauxdaughterboardfamily. NoNVMeonIO3V3/moduleaux. Modulepin92conflict retainedNC.\nSPI GPIO-CS transport/pinmux/loadeddeadline, nativeparentintegration, routing/return/EMC/thermal/watchdog and physicalprototypes remain required."(at 430 780 0)(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top))(uuid "8067d869-b7dc-507e-a73a-9423651b48e9"))
